    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94d50b0b246c5f3132a9654b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不会再迷茫！\n从开始到结束，这都是属于我自己的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "834bdfed91fcfcbffa9302e38e4fca43719dd673323b190ff1e1dd6bacc9ff67",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077334.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc2583e06979a1a461e30136",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好歌剧",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e675a751a02376dc54b1b2892d4a4f859f0505240d1cc6277fe26728ca618f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077334.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95bd5916a11ccf8a4076fe44",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "噢噢噢噢，休想把我压下去！！\n哪怕对手是神仙亦或是佛陀！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d58b123cffc4ee89dfff15d07e035bd6903a5ceb00bfda6647df423c33f3c454",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077334.json",
      "json_path": [
